=== BERTopic variations <res:bertvar>

This section present the results from two variations of BERTopic that aimed to reduce the amount of documents labeled as noise. The first variation, referred to as BERTopic-@hdbscan modifies the clustering parameters of @hdbscan to allow for more outliers to be assigned to topics. The second variation, referred to as BERTopic-Reassign simply reassigns all noise labeled documents to the closest topic after the clustering algorithm as finished.



==== modified @hdbscan parameters <res:hdscan>
The result of changing the @hdbscan parameters are shown in @table:bertparam in the same format as in @res:bertopic. Similarly, in many of the runs the topics did not contain enough words to meet the 10 word requirement needed for evaluation. 

