The @d1 embeddings now perform better than the embeddings based on the @bow representation. The coherence is lower for the @d2 embeddings in all cases except for $K=10$. Compared to the base BERTopic model, the @d2 embeddings model has significantly decreased while the @d1 embeddings remains somewhat similar.

