==== BERTopic reassignment <res:reass>
This section shows the result of using the reassignment strategy to reduce noise. Results are presented inthe same format as in @res:bertopic. Similarly, in many of the runs the topics did not contain enough words to meet the 10 word requirement needed for evaluation

@table:bertreassign shows how the reassignment strategy retains high in coherence compared to the values of the base model in @table:bertopicbase. The diversity does however decrease somewhat. This means that the reassignment strategy does not incur the same penalty as when modifying the @hdbscan parameters in @res:hdscan.


